  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida bidrar till l&#xf6;nekostnaden f&#xf6;r hemv&#xe4;ndande arbetsl&#xf6;sa deltagare i resursbasprogrammen under max 5 m&#xe5;nader under f&#xf6;ruts&#xe4;ttning att de    sj&#xe4;lva hittar ett arbete, Avsikten med bidraget &#xe4;r att underl&#xe4;tta     &#xe5;terintr&#xe4;det p&#xe5; den svenska arbetsmarknaden.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida contributes to salary costs for homecoming unemployed            participants of resource base programs during a maximum of five       months on condition that they find a job. The object with this        contribution is to facilitate the reentry into the Swedish labour     market.</narrative>
